      "title": "LRCX Q1 Earnings Call Highlights $200B-Plus WFE Outlook for 2027",
      "summary": "Lam Research (LRCX) projects wafer fabrication equipment (WFE) spending will exceed $200 billion in 2027, driven by AI demand and chip manufacturing complexity. The company guided December-quarter revenues to $8.6B and raised its Aether dry resist technology revenue outlook to $2.5B by decade-end. Supply chain constraints are impacting near-term shipments, though customer demand visibility extends through 2028.",
