      "title": "Lam Research Q1 Earnings Beat on Systems Sales and Margin Gains",
      "summary": "Lam Research (LRCX) delivered exceptional Q1'27 results with EPS of $2.20 (up 74.6% YoY) and revenues of $8.22B (up 54.4% YoY), beating consensus estimates. Systems revenues surged 61.6% driven by strong NAND and foundry demand, while gross margin hit a record 52.4%. The company generated record free cash flow of $3.24B and projects Q2 EPS of $2.33, with expectations for wafer fabrication equipment spending to exceed $200B in 2027.",
